OverTheWire Bandit: Level 13 → 14

Objective
Obtain the password for Level 14.
The password is stored in /etc/bandit_pass/bandit14 and can only be accessed using SSH with a private key.

Steps
Log in as bandit13:
ssh bandit13@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220
Use the provided private SSH key to log in as bandit14:
ssh bandit14@localhost -i sshkey.private
Read the password file:
cat /etc/bandit_pass/bandit14

Result
The file contains the password for Bandit Level 14.
